{
 "title": "DMARC",
 "uid": "dmarc",
 "tags": [
  "dmarc",
  "mail",
  "apps"
 ],
 "description": "DMARC aggregate reports for the domains this cluster sends mail for, parsed out of the dmarc@ IMAP mailbox by dmarc-metrics-exporter (kubernetes/apps/mail/dmarc-exporter/).\n\nTwo things to know before reading any number here.\n\nFirst, every value is an absolute counter covering the exporter's whole history, not the dashboard window. The counters are written to metrics.db on the exporter's PVC and read back at startup (MetricsPersister.load), so they survive restarts and reconciles -- totals only ever grow, and the window selector affects just the time series and \"New in window\".\n\nSecond, this measures what receivers report, not what was sent. Reports arrive once a day at best and only from receivers that bother, so the window defaults to 30 days and a quiet dashboard means nobody reported -- not that nothing was delivered.",
 "schemaVersion": 39,
 "version": 1,
 "editable": true,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "refresh": "5m",
 "time": {
  "from": "now-30d",
  "to": "now"
 },
 "timezone": "",
 "annotations": {
  "list": []
 },
 "templating": {
  "list": []
 },
 "panels": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Exporter up",
   "description": "0 means Prometheus did not reach the exporter. Every total below is then whatever the last successful scrape saw.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 4,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "up{job=\"dmarc-exporter\"}",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "mappings": [
      {
       "type": "value",
       "options": {
        "0": {
         "text": "NO",
         "color": "red"
        },
        "1": {
         "text": "yes",
         "color": "green"
        }
       }
      }
     ],
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "justifyMode": "auto",
    "textMode": "auto",
    "orientation": "auto",
    "wideLayout": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "DMARC compliance",
   "description": "Share of reported messages that satisfied DMARC: SPF or DKIM passed *and* was aligned with the From domain. Covers every report the exporter has ever parsed, not the dashboard window -- the counters are absolute and persisted.\n\nReads NaN rather than 0% when nothing has been reported yet, which is the honest answer: no reports is not the same as no compliance.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 5,
    "x": 4,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "100 * sum(dmarc_compliant_total) / sum(dmarc_total)",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "percent",
     "mappings": [],
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "orange",
        "value": 95
       },
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": 99
       }
      ]
     },
     "decimals": 1
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "justifyMode": "auto",
    "textMode": "auto",
    "orientation": "auto",
    "wideLayout": true
   }
  },
