  {
   "id": 4,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "New in window",
   "description": "Messages added within the dashboard's time range.\n\nDeliberately a difference of two absolute reads rather than increase(): a report from a new sender/reporter pair creates a new series, and increase() cannot see a series' very first sample. Measured on this data it returned 0 while the total had in fact risen by one. The offset read is guarded with \"or vector(0)\" so a window reaching past the start of the series shows the full total instead of nothing.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 5,
    "x": 14,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "sum(dmarc_total) - (sum(dmarc_total offset $__range) or vector(0))",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short",
     "mappings": [],
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "text",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "reduceOptions": {
     "calcs": [
      "lastNotNull"
     ],
     "fields": "",
     "values": false
    },
    "colorMode": "background",
    "graphMode": "none",
    "justifyMode": "auto",
    "textMode": "auto",
    "orientation": "auto",
    "wideLayout": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "type": "stat",
   "title": "Exporter uptime",
   "description": "Age of the exporter process.\n\nDoes not bound the totals on this dashboard, which is the easy wrong assumption to make: the counters are persisted to metrics.db on the PVC and restored at startup, so they predate the current process. Verified against the running pod -- the file holds the same values Prometheus serves. Low uptime therefore means a recent restart, not reset counters.",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 5,
    "x": 19,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "prometheus",
      "uid": "prometheus"
     },
     "expr": "time() - process_start_time_seconds{job=\"dmarc-exporter\"}",
     "instant": true
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "s",
     "mappings": [],
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "text",
        "value": null
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
